WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.169
Ikkinchi qismda ikki narsani o‘rganamiz.

2
00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.040
Birinchisi,

3
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:12.517
ildizlar karrali bo‘lganda va tenglama tartibi uchdan yuqori bo‘lganda fundamental sistemani qanday tuzish.

4
00:00:12.517 --> 00:00:18.776
Ikkinchisi, amaliy masala: prujinadagi yukning erkin harakati qachon tebranadi,

5
00:00:18.776 --> 00:00:22.262
qachon esa tebranmasdan muvozanatga qaytadi.

6
00:00:22.512 --> 00:00:29.967
Qoida: agar r nol ildiz k karrali bo‘lsa, unga k ta funksiya mos keladi: e daraja r nol iks,

7
00:00:29.967 --> 00:00:36.612
iks marta shu eksponenta, va hokazo, iks daraja k minus bir marta eksponentagacha.

8
00:00:36.612 --> 00:00:43.662
Kompleks juftlik ham karrali bo‘lsa, kosinus va sinusni iks darajalariga ko‘paytiramiz.

9
00:00:43.662 --> 00:00:47.390
Funksiyalar soni doim tenglama tartibiga teng.

10
00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:54.778
Misol: y uch shtrix plyus y ikki shtrix minus y shtrix minus y teng nol.

11
00:00:54.778 --> 00:01:00.925
Xarakteristik ko‘phad r kub plyus r kvadrat minus r minus bir.

12
00:01:00.925 --> 00:01:06.874
Guruhlaymiz: r kvadrat marta r plyus bir, minus r plyus bir.

13
00:01:06.874 --> 00:01:11.534
Natija: r plyus bir kvadrati marta r minus bir.

14
00:01:11.784 --> 00:01:15.662
Bir oddiy ildiz e daraja iks ni beradi.

15
00:01:15.662 --> 00:01:24.312
Minus bir ikki karrali, u e daraja minus iks va iks marta e daraja minus iks ni beradi.

16
00:01:24.312 --> 00:01:27.892
Jami uchta funksiya, tartib ham uch.

17
00:01:27.892 --> 00:01:37.934
Umumiy yechim: C bir e daraja iks plyus qavs ichida C ikki plyus C uch iks, marta e daraja minus iks.

18
00:01:38.184 --> 00:01:39.631
Endi prujina.

19
00:01:39.631 --> 00:01:44.861
Massa m, qarshilik koeffitsiyenti c, bikrlik k.

20
00:01:44.861 --> 00:01:52.318
Nyuton qonuni: m y ikki shtrix plyus c y shtrix plyus k y teng nol.

21
00:01:52.318 --> 00:01:58.550
Hammasini c kvadrat minus to‘rt m k ishorasi hal qiladi.

22
00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:03.336
Manfiy bo‘lsa, kuchsiz so‘nuvchi tebranish.

23
00:02:03.336 --> 00:02:06.341
Nol bo‘lsa, kritik so‘nish.

24
00:02:06.341 --> 00:02:11.126
Musbat bo‘lsa, tebranishsiz kuchli so‘nish.

25
00:02:11.376 --> 00:02:20.094
Misol: m bir, c ikki, k besh, yuk bir metrga tortilib, tezliksiz qo‘yib yuborildi.

26
00:02:20.094 --> 00:02:24.134
Ildizlar minus bir plyus minus ikki i.

27
00:02:24.134 --> 00:02:28.067
Shartlardan A teng bir, B teng yarim.

28
00:02:28.067 --> 00:02:35.616
Yechim: e daraja minus t marta kosinus ikki t plyus yarim sinus ikki t.

29
00:02:35.616 --> 00:02:37.742
Kvazidavr pi sekund.

30
00:02:37.992 --> 00:02:45.901
Uch holatni bir grafikda solishtiramiz, hammasi bir xil boshlang‘ich holatdan boshlanadi.

31
00:02:45.901 --> 00:02:50.878
Birinchi chiziq kuchsiz so‘nish: nol atrofida tebranadi.

32
00:02:50.878 --> 00:02:58.342
Ikkinchisi kritik so‘nish, c teng to‘rt, k teng to‘rt: tebranmasdan eng tez qaytadi.

33
00:02:58.342 --> 00:03:03.230
Uchinchisi kuchli so‘nish: sekin, tebranishsiz qaytadi.

34
00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:06.025
Savol: massasi ikki kilogramm,

35
00:03:06.025 --> 00:03:14.253
bikrligi sakkiz bo‘lgan prujina uchun kritik so‘nishga qaysi qarshilik koeffitsiyenti mos keladi?

36
00:03:14.253 --> 00:03:17.901
Formulani eslang: c kvadrat teng to‘rt m k.

37
00:03:17.901 --> 00:03:20.870
Videoni to‘xtatib, javobni tanlang.
